{"games":[{"id":14125634878,"name":"PROVE MOM WRONG + BE FAMOUS ! ⭐","desc":"📱 Record videos\n🎉 Grow your following\n⭐ Become famous!\n\nYou are a young and ambitious content creator who wants to make a living out of your online passion. You love creating videos online. However, your mom doesn’t get it. She thinks you are lazy, irresponsible, and delusional. She wants you to get a real job and start acting like an adult.\n\nIn this game, you grow your content creator career and prove your mom wrong by rebuying the house you guys owned.\n\n(Use the phone to record videos and after you will be able to publish the videos by using the computer pointed by the game guide, from there your videos will be in trending and are going to generate money which you can use to buy objects around the house)","path":"/game/14125634878-prove-mom-wrong-be-famous","slug":"14125634878-prove-mom-wrong-be-famous","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8d8e5f87595170095c2b3ae554a68721c3182dcd2264ca41b58952ef221feea6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-63a2bfb7ede4b1df9c913b9d9cc8f592/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":16,"visitor":26739575,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2023-12-13T11:30:45.008Z","creator":{"name":"Mac & Cheeese","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":13900376114,"name":"Push Up Training Simulator","desc":"Welcome to Push Up Training Simulator where you explore the map to uncover push up techniques and train your body to the fullest.\n\n- Tap to equip your training tool or press \"1\" then click anywhere to start training\n- Click or tap the white box to choose stronger push up techniques to perform\n- Search for your next push up techniques using \"[ Rank ]\" to see their requirements\n\n: Discover new push up techniques around the map\n: Get stronger to learn new push up forms\n: Achieve higher strength and obtain stronger ranks\n: Push up to become better and stronger\n: Compete other players and become t